diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b677f4e..51fdeeb 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -7,3 +7,12 @@ A small expense ledger. Entries live in a JSON file (`--data` or `$LEDGER_DATA`)
     python -m ledger report --by month
 
 Tests: `python -m unittest discover -s tests`.
+
+Add a bounded monthly series with `--repeat monthly --until YYYY-MM-DD`:
+
+    python -m ledger add 2026-01-31 12.50 food "subscription" --repeat monthly --until 2026-03-31
+
+The end date is inclusive. Occurrences use the original day of the month, or
+that month's last day when it is shorter. Lists and reports include all
+occurrences, including future dates. Series are stored as single records in the
+JSON list alongside ordinary entries.
